lped me playtest it, taken the demo for a spin, shared it with a friend, reported a bug, or joined the conversation on Dis","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T14:42:53Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706690564","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:25:17Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4802240-1844751498218850","game_id":"steam-4802240","kind":"announcement","title":"The Starforge Pirate Demo Is Here!","summary":"🚀 The Starforge Pirate Demo Is Here!The wait is over — the Starforge Pirate Demo is now available!Jump into a fast-paced arcade roguelite where every run is a gamble, every upgrade can change your build, and one bad decision can leave your ship drifting through space.And there’s more: Starforge Pirate will also be featured during the upcoming Steam Next Fest this October! So if you enjoy the demo, be sure to add the game to your wishlist and come back during Next Fest to play, explore, and follo","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-23T15:50:35Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498218850","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:25:17Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4802240":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T04:25:10Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T04:25:10Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4802240":"2026-10-26T04:25:10Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4802240":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T04:25:10Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T04:25:10Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"4933520":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T04:25:10Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T04:25:10Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4802240","app_id":4802240,"app_scope":"b